WEBVTT

00:02:01.000 --> 00:02:03.191
was finally put back
on the throne of England.

00:02:03.215 --> 00:02:05.501
He was really nervous,
because his dad had been,

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:08.286
you know, beheaded for being
the King of England

00:02:08.310 --> 00:02:10.310
And he was nervous about the fact

00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:12.976
that conversations that got going

00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:14.976
in, like, bars and stuff

00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:16.976
would turn to --

00:02:17.000 --> 00:02:18.976
this is kind of -- it's hard to believe,

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:20.976
but people in the 17th century in England

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:22.976
were starting to talk about, you know,

00:02:23.000 --> 00:02:24.976
philosophy and stuff in bars.

00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:26.976
They didn't have TV screens,

00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:29.334
and they didn't have
any football games to watch.

00:02:29.358 --> 00:02:30.976
And they would get really pissy,